<form method="get" class="nm-card rekap-class-picker p-4 mb-3"><label for="rekapPengajaranNilai" class="form-label fw-semibold"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Mata pelajaran dan kelas</label><select id="rekapPengajaranNilai" name="pengajaran_id" class="form-select" onchange="this.form.submit()"><option value="">Pilih kelas</option><?php foreach($assignments as $a): ?><option value="<?= (int)$a['id'] ?>" <?= (int)$a['id']===$pid?'selected':'' ?>><?= sanitize($a['nama_mapel'].' — '.$a['nama_kelas'].' ('.$a['semester'].', '.$a['tahun_ajaran'].')') ?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></form>
<?php if($info): ?>
<div class="rekap-settings"><details class="rekap-guide mb-3"><summary>Cara membaca dan mengisi nilai</summary><div class="small mt-2">Tugas Harian mengikuti nilai tugas lewat tenggat dan nilai manual lama yang masih tersimpan. Tugas yang sudah dikumpulkan tetapi belum dinilai tidak dirata-ratakan; tugas lewat tenggat yang tidak dikumpulkan bernilai 0. Ulangan Harian mengikuti ujian yang jadwalnya sudah berakhir. Nilai pengganti manual tetap berlaku sampai dikembalikan ke otomatis.</div></details>
<details class="nm-card rekap-weights p-4 mb-3"><summary class="fw-semibold">Atur bobot penilaian <span class="rekap-weight-total"><?= sanitize((string)$weight) ?>%</span></summary><div class="table-responsive mt-3"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Komponen</th><th>Bobot (%)</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($components as $c): ?><tr><td colspan="3"><form class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center" method="post" action="rekap_nilai_action.php"><?php $hidden('update'); ?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int)$c['id'] ?>"><input type="hidden" name="nama_komponen" value="<?= sanitize($c['nama_komponen']) ?>"><strong class="me-auto"><?= sanitize($c['nama_komponen']) ?></strong><input type="number" name="bobot" min="0.01" max="100" step="0.01" class="form-control nm-score" aria-label="Bobot <?= sanitize($c['nama_komponen']) ?>" value="<?= sanitize((string)$c['bobot']) ?>" required><button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">Simpan Bobot</button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach ?></tbody></table></div><form class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3" method="post" action="rekap_nilai_action.php"><?php $hidden('add'); ?><select name="nama_komponen" class="form-select nm-upload" aria-label="Komponen baru" required><?php foreach(['Tugas Harian','Ulangan Harian','Kehadiran','UTS','UAS','Ujian Praktik'] as $name): if(in_array($name,array_column($components,'nama_komponen'),true))continue; ?><option><?= sanitize($name) ?></option><?php endforeach ?></select><input name="bobot" type="number" min="0.01" max="100" step="0.01" placeholder="Bobot %" aria-label="Bobot komponen baru" class="form-control nm-score" required><button class="btn btn-primary">Tambah Komponen</button></form></details></div>
